<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Istrobanka 96 net rises to SKK 100.74 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Istrobanka 96 net rises to SKK 100.74 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Net profit		   100.740     vs     74.833</p>
<p> Balance sheet total   21,100.000     vs 11,768.000</p>
<p> Credits to clients    10,800.000     vs  5,800.000</p>
<p> Basic capital	    1,000.000     vs  1,000.000</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is Istrobanka a.s.. The bank is headquartered in Bratislava, has 12 branches across the country.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
